---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro"
---

<Layout>
    <h1>Tools I Use</h1>
    <p>This is a list of hardware and software I like to use in my day to day, either for work and personal use.</p>
    <p>Setup:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>[Laptop] <mark>HP OMEN 15 AMD Ryzen 7</mark> // I would like to upgrade soon when I have money for it;</li>
        <li>[<a href="https://linuxmint.com/" target="_blank">Operating System</a>] <mark>Linux Mint - Cinnamon</mark> // It's so awesome;</li>
        <li>[<a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AXPw6ctDYH0" target="_blank">Mechanical Keyboard</a>] <mark>Ajazz AK820 Pro</mark> // My pride and joy;</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Development:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>[<a href="https://code.visualstudio.com/" target="_blank">IDE</a>] <mark>Visual Studio Code</mark> // The most complete coding IDE I've ever used; </li>
        <li>[<a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/products/pages/" target="_blank">Hosting</a>] <mark>Cloudflare Pages</mark> // Where I host all my static websites (except this one);</li>
        <li>[<a href="https://astro.build/" target="_blank">Framework</a>] <mark>Astro</mark> // The best for creating static websites of all levels of complexity;</li>
        <li>[<a href="https://laravel.com/" target="_blank">Framework</a>] <mark>Laravel</mark> // When it comes to full-stack applications, Laravel is my favorite (I love the redemption story of PHP);</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Design & Art:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>[<a href="https://www.figma.com/" target="_blank">Web Design</a>] <mark>Figma</mark> // Kinda the only viable web design tool option nowadays tbh; </li>
        <li>[<a href="https://www.affinity.studio/" target="_blank">Graphic Design</a>] <mark>Affinity Suite</mark> // My Adobe replacement;</li>
        <li>[<a href="https://krita.org" target="_blank">Digital Art</a>] <mark>Krita</mark> // Open-source art program, my favorite;</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Organization & Planning:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>[<a href="https://obsidian.md/" target="_blank">Notes</a>] <mark>Obsidian</mark> // File-based note-taking and management app. It rocks; </li>
        <li>[<a href="https://miro.com/" target="_blank">Moodboards</a>] <mark>Miro</mark> // How I plan my projects;</li>
    </ul>
</Layout>